@@ -62,3 +62,5 @@ To set up a webhook:
 3. Click **Create webhook**.
 
 PostHog automatically creates and registers the webhook on your Stripe account. Once set up, you can view the webhook status, including both PostHog's internal status and the Stripe-side webhook status, from the **Webhook** tab.
+
+Real-time webhook ingestion only begins after the table's first sync has completed successfully. Until then, the table continues to sync on its regular schedule. If you do a full reset or re-sync of the table, webhook ingestion pauses and the table falls back to scheduled syncing until the initial sync completes again.
